<title>USA: Reliance okays five percent shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Reliance okays five percent shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY, N.Y. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Bancorp Inc, the holding company for Reliance Federal Savings Bank, said Friday it has been authorized by its board to repurchase up to 5 percent of its 8,819,457 outstanding shares during the next twelve months.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be made in open-market or privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
